                                "sense_id": "81644a7d-7ba3-3dc8-921b-ffeeaa0c736d",
                                "text": "June 22, 1772, Horace Walpole, letter to the Hon. H. S. Conway\nI tired myself with walking on Friday; the gout came on Saturday in my foot; yesterday I kept my bed till four o’ clock and my room all day—but with wrapping myself all over with bootikins, I have scarce had any pain."
